## 📈 Metrics Collection

### Prometheus Metrics
The application exposes Prometheus metrics via [backend/metrics.py](mdc:backend/metrics.py):

```python
from backend.metrics import (
    request_counter, request_duration, job_counter,
    job_duration, gpu_memory_usage, active_jobs_gauge
)

# HTTP request metrics
request_counter.labels(method="POST", endpoint="/api/generate", status="200").inc()
request_duration.labels(method="POST", endpoint="/api/generate").observe(1.5)

# Job metrics
job_counter.labels(workflow="moneyprinter", status="completed").inc()
job_duration.labels(workflow="moneyprinter").observe(300)  # 5 minutes

# Resource metrics
gpu_memory_usage.set(7.2)  # 7.2GB
active_jobs_gauge.set(3)   # 3 active jobs
```

